# MediVault AWS Infrastructure

## 1. Project Overview

MediVault is a healthcare application that allows users to store medical scan images.

This project focuses on designing and building the cloud infrastructure required to run MediVault using AWS services.

The infrastructure will be developed progressively as different AWS services are learned.

---

## 2. Initial Objective

The initial version of MediVault will consist of:

- One EC2 instance hosting the application
- One S3 bucket for storing scan images
- A VPC with separate Production and Management network segments
- IAM users, groups and roles for access control
- CloudWatch monitoring for infrastructure and storage

